            <ArticleTitle>Update on treatments for neuropathic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>54-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pharmacotherapy for which there is evidence of efficacy in neuropathic pain management is described. The role of opioids is discussed in the context of recent controlled trials. Evidence to support combination pharmacotherapy for neuropathic pain management is presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
